Document Infrastructure with DSL and Diagrams
Objectives
By the end of this lab, you will be able to:

Create a standard DevOps repository folder structure
Write clear documentation (README.md) for infrastructure repositories
Build a YAML-based infrastructure manifest describing a three-tier application
Document compute, networking, and storage components in a structured format
Create a basic deployment plan with rollback procedures
Generate a simple architecture diagram using a text-based diagramming tool
Prerequisites
Basic familiarity with the Linux terminal (navigating folders, creating files)
No prior YAML or diagramming experience required
A single Linux machine (provided via Al Nafi Start Lab)
Environment Setup
Start your Linux lab machine from Al Nafi.
Open a terminal.
